; TeX-Startup: start-up file of the TeX-Shell (NewShell ... FROM this).
; The usual Shell start-up first, then the TeX settings.
If EXISTS S:Shell-Startup
  Execute S:Shell-Startup
EndIf
Execute TeX:S/TeX-Assigns
Echo "TeX Live for AmigaOS 3:  pdflatex  lualatex  bibtex  makeindex  tex"
Echo "Documents can be anywhere; CD there first.  Help: TeX:ReadMe"
